        {
            "title": "Assault to Yourmomdy reaches new depths",
            "date": "2019-05-10 18:22:26",
            "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/2405396896213588357",
            "notes": "Version 0.9938 is here with a flag contest mode which is a mini Battle Royale for the ownership of each flag. [b]The match is not just ONE BATTLE ROYALE but MANY BATTLE ROYALES[/b]! How about that battle royale games! How many battle royales can you fit into a match >:D \r\n\r\nTanks![b] That can jump[/b] and have [b]jetpacks[/b]! With [b]Nukes [/b]and [b]shotguns[/b]!\r\n\r\nHow about projectiles instead of hitscan weapons? [u]Destructible landscape![/u]\r\n\r\nGuided missiles, mines, turrets, mortar traps.\r\n\r\nFive tank classes!\r\n\r\nGet the [b]free demo[/b] now or the full game! Costs you the amount of an adult beverage to keep this hobby project going.\r\n\r\nUpdates:\r\n- Nukes more expensive\r\n- Inertia nullifier cheaper\r\n- Maneuverability adjustments\r\n- Ships moved closer in Jormandy\r\n- Contest mode: scoring system tuned to favor winnings instead of owning flags\r\n-"
        },
